{% extends 'base.html.j2' %}
{% from 'components.html.j2' import eyebrow, faq, cta with context %}
{% block content %}
<section class="page-hero wrap"><div>{{ eyebrow('YOUR THAILAND VISA DESK') }}<h1>The right route starts<br>with <em>your life.</em></h1><p>Remote work, retirement, family or a new opportunity. Compare the routes, understand the questions, then take a more informed next step.</p><div class="button-row"><a class="button" href="{{ url('tools/visa-finder/') }}">Find my visa options {{ icon('arrow') }}</a><a class="text-link" href="{{ url('contact/') }}">Talk to our desk {{ icon('arrow') }}</a></div></div><div class="page-hero-note">{{ icon('passport') }}<h2>Your purpose.<br>Your evidence.<br>Your next step.</h2><p>A route comparison helps you ask better questions. The authorities decide eligibility.</p></div></section>
<section class="section soft-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div>{{ eyebrow('COMPARE YOUR OPTIONS') }}<h2>Different routes.<br>Different reasons to come.</h2></div><p>Start with the closest fit.<br>Check the details for your circumstances.</p></div><div class="visa-grid">{% for visa in visas %}<article class="visa-card"><div class="visa-card-top">{{ icon(visa.icon) }}<span class="tag">{{ visa.badge }}</span></div><h3>{{ visa.short }}</h3><p class="visa-label">{{ visa.label }}</p><p>{{ visa.summary }}</p><a class="text-link" href="{{ url('visas/' ~ visa.slug ~ '/') }}">Explore this route {{ icon('arrow') }}</a></article>{% endfor %}</div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap narrow">{{ eyebrow('COMPARE BEFORE YOU COMMIT') }}<h2>A clear route review<br>answers four questions.</h2><ol class="number-list"><li><strong>Does it fit what I intend to do?</strong><p>Work, study, family and leisure are different purposes.</p></li><li><strong>Can I provide the evidence?</strong><p>Use the current requirements of the authority handling your application.</p></li><li><strong>What is the full cost?</strong><p>Separate official fees, service fees and third-party costs.</p></li><li><strong>What happens after arrival?</strong><p>Know the length of permission, conditions and next deadlines.</p></li></ol></div></section>
{{ faq(faqs) }}{{ cta() }}
{% endblock %}

